{"title":"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bdc4e20e2729ae12f5f651d60144a5ee86d097.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,-4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> lies on the straight line joining the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e7b4544e20b2cd42bda429683fd14d5ad24f085.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb3756c0b0341e1204ef42665140f593d26308e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-4,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />-plane, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/7/ff70d4d7c2f943709be4bae0a465c8a13fb7ea81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }-2\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }-8\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }6\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }-6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"419\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bdc4e20e2729ae12f5f651d60144a5ee86d097.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,-4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> is on the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e7b4544e20b2cd42bda429683fd14d5ad24f085.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb3756c0b0341e1204ef42665140f593d26308e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-4,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />, the slope between the latter two is the same as the slope between the former two, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/0/270f11e9cc3d2e433a339ce86226d86bfd07d6bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-4-8}{x-0}=\\frac{8-0}{0-(-4)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"154\" height=\"42\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d39ee1a080e33a99bf1d95b95dcbcae65ad9b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-6$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/1/0b1b1cbed6cff553a60356586c44e4bf25d7f5ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }-6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"78\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME\" title=\"1971 AHSME\">1971 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1971 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1971\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\